# Rank 106 / CVE-2012-5666: ownCloud Bookmarks inserts window.location into
# generated bookmark HTML before escaping the current page URL (CWE-79).
#
# VYQL-INJ-004 fires when the location string reaches the bookmark HTML render.
# The snippet expects the finding.

test "rank106: location string reaches bookmark html rendering"
  expect VYQL-INJ-004
  graph
  ```
  node src core.UserControlledData
  node sink code.HtmlRender
  edge FLOWS src -> sink
  ```

